{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"caff5b40a70305f8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Clockwork.** Spells are cast through specially designed clockwork contraptions",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-160,
			"width":340,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"feea4acdb125447f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Magical Works.** Caster can create contraptions capable of casting spells given proper time and materials. They take up one slot each, drawing on the user's magic to remain operable. Creating above max disables the last, rendering it reusable scrap as the machines seize up for good",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-520,
			"width":340,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"6bd9f42188049bbe",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Emmenating Works.** Caster can create special contraptions capable of creating spells in an aura around it, able to last until disabled",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-780,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"d435ad6b7f341ba5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Fuzed Contraptions.** Caster can combine a variety of contraptions together, combining spell effects. Each part consumes a contraption slot. If the caster exceeds their alotted slots with this as the oldest, the caster can choose one part of this contraption to disable, spending time to remove it if they wish",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-1360,
			"width":340,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"0909cc8741e6c9d5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Powered Contraptions.** Caster can power external powers. These decices count as half a device when made this way",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":240,
			"y":-1010,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"001b9dc84762d251",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Automatic Works.** Caster can create automated contraptions that can perform simple movements on their own",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-1000,
			"width":340,
			"height":120
		}
	],
